prop coolcrank if.use=!signal|cooling
prop coolcrank on.use=signal||cooling\ngive||story:cooling*1\nmessage||The crank turns, stiff, then easy. The cabinets' hum steadies.

# --- DEEP 10-24: M14 timed terminal run (three terminals, a 90 s window, cold vents), the vent tower, the crevasse ---
story interlock|The flood interlock|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The flood door's interlock key, from the vent shaft's head on the ice cap.
note interlockplate Control door interlock | CONTROL ROOM - INTERLOCK\n\nThree terminals open this door:\n  SNOWFLAKE - the seed wing\n  LEAF - the record wing\n  DROP - the embryo wing, behind the frost shutter\nThe snowflake wakes the interlock: the frost shutter opens for NINETY SECONDS and the vents run cold. Enter the leaf and the drop before it shuts.\nEach code is its wing's catalogue number. The drop's is the keeper's own.
note seedboard Seed catalogue | SEED WING - CATALOGUE BOARD (snowflake)\n\nBarley, winter strain ..... shelf 1\nRye, northern .............. shelf 2\nWHOLE WING, catalogue no. 3317
note recordboard Record catalogue | RECORD WING - CATALOGUE BOARD (leaf)\n\nFounders' record ......... case 1\nCouncil papers ........... case 2\nWHOLE WING, catalogue no. 5081
note ventnote Vent keeper's note | VENT KEEPER\n\nI keep the vault breathing. The shaft on the ice cap is its lung and I am its cough, the Warden says. He means it kindly. Mostly.\nThe flood door below the vault will not lift without the interlock. When the water came into the Ark I carried the interlock up to the shaft head and left it in the chest by the cairn, so no frightened fool would open the door and drown the whole vault.\nNow the courier has been asking about the Ark. Twice. Orrin, with snow in his beard and no jokes left in him. I did not tell him. I think he found another way down.\nIf you are the one who chooses: the Seed Ark lies under the flood door, on 400. Take air.\n\n- Esko, vent keeper
note ventchest Vent shaft chest | The vent keeper's chest: the flood door's interlock, in oilcloth.
loot ventchest MetalIngot*2;Bolt*2;Rope*2
prop ventchest loot.refill=0
prop ventchest on.open=give||story:interlock*1\nmessage||The interlock: a brass key as long as your forearm. The flood door's lever will take it.
note ventcavechest Vent keeper's bedroll | The vent keeper's bedroll and box: tins, a lamp wick, rope.
loot ventcavechest Rope*3;Scrap*2;Raw_GenericMeat*2
prop ventcavechest loot.refill=0
note crevchest Survey boat's strongbox | The survey boat's strongbox, 16 m down in the flooded crevasse.
loot crevchest TitaniumOre*2;MetalIngot*2;Glass*2
prop treasure12971 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*1;CopperOre*3
prop treasure12972 treasure.loot=MetalOre*3;Scrap*3
prop term1 obj.name=term1
prop term1 beh.use=Type the snowflake terminal's code
prop term1 lock.code=3317
prop term1 if.use=!signal|controlcode\nstate|frostshutter|closed
prop term1 on.use=sound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/reactor_alarm\nmessage||The interlock wakes. In the embryo wing the frost shutter grinds down - and the vents start blowing freezing air. Ninety seconds.\nopen|frostshutter\nshow|coldrun\nwait|90\nclose|frostshutter\nhide|coldrun
prop term1 else.use=message||The interlock is already running - or done.
prop term2 obj.name=term2
prop term2 beh.use=Type the leaf terminal's code
prop term2 lock.code=5081
prop term2 if.use=state|frostshutter|open
prop term2 on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nsignal||term2\nmessage||Leaf: accepted. Now the drop - in the embryo wing, before the shutter shuts.
prop term2 else.use=message||The leaf terminal is dead. The interlock sleeps - the snowflake terminal (seed wing) wakes it.
prop term3 obj.name=term3
prop term3 beh.use=Type the drop terminal's code
prop term3 lock.code=2240
prop term3 if.use=state|frostshutter|open\nsignal|term2
prop term3 on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||Drop: accepted. The vents fall quiet, and across the vault the control room's door slides away.\nhide|controldoor\nhide|frostshutter\nhide|coldrun\nsignal||controlcode\ngive||story:controlcode*1
prop term3 else.use=message||The drop terminal wants the interlock awake and the leaf entered first - snowflake, leaf, drop, within ninety seconds.
prop frostshutter obj.name=frostshutter
prop frostshutter beh.move=0,-2.95,0
prop frostshutter beh.moveTime=3
prop frostshutter beh.moveMode=switch
prop coldrun beh.hidden=1
prop verdictkeep beh.hidden=1
prop verdictcarry beh.hidden=1
prop verdictbroadcast beh.hidden=1
prop keepchest beh.hidden=1
prop carrychest beh.hidden=1
prop broadcastchest beh.hidden=1
prop heddacall beh.hidden=1
prop keeplever obj.name=keeplever
prop keeplever beh.use=Pull KEEP
prop keeplever if.use=signal|controlcode\n!signal|chosen
prop keeplever on.use=signal||keep\nsignal||chosen\ngive||story:choice*1\nshow|verdictkeep\nshow|keepchest\nshow|heddacall\nmessage||KEEP. You push the switch home under the Warden's tape. Bolts slam through the vault; the lights steady.\nmessage||Oda, at the door, quietly: he would have liked that. I am not sure I do.
prop carrylever obj.name=carrylever
prop carrylever beh.use=Pull CARRY
prop carrylever if.use=signal|controlcode\n!signal|chosen
prop carrylever on.use=signal||carry\nsignal||chosen\ngive||story:choice*1\nshow|verdictcarry\nshow|carrychest\nshow|heddacall\nmessage||CARRY. Far off, the seed store's sea gate grinds open. At the entrance hall, a crate rolls out on its rails.\nmessage||Oda, at the door: seeds are for planting. Verdance will have barley by spring.
prop broadcastlever obj.name=broadcastlever
prop broadcastlever beh.use=Pull BROADCAST
prop broadcastlever if.use=signal|controlcode\n!signal|chosen
prop broadcastlever on.use=signal||broadcast\nsignal||chosen\ngive||story:choice*1\nshow|verdictbroadcast\nshow|broadcastchest\nshow|heddacall\nmessage||BROADCAST. Every radio in the vault comes alive at once, reading the founders' record into every band.\nmessage||Oda, at the door, laughing: well. Now everyone knows we are here.
prop floodlever obj.name=floodlever
prop floodlever beh.use=Open the flood door
prop floodlever if.use=signal|chosen\n!signal|flooddoor\ntake|story:interlock|1
prop floodlever on.use=signal||flooddoor\ngive||story:flooddoor*1\nhide|flooddoor\nmessage||The flood door grinds up. Black water below, and far down, lamps still burning: the Seed Ark.
prop floodlever else.use=message||Not before the vault's way is chosen - and the lever's interlock is gone. The vent keeper took it somewhere high.

note councilbox Council box | Saga Drift's council box: their tokens, a titanium bar, the city seal.
loot councilbox TradeToken*6;TitaniumIngot*1;CopperIngot*2
prop councilbox loot.refill=0
prop councilbox obj.name=councilbox
prop councilbox if.open=signal|councilcode
prop councilbox else.open=message||The council's box is locked. Its keypad wants four digits - a year, by the look of the scratches.
story councilcode|The council box's code|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|Saga Drift's founding year opened the council's box.
prop councilpad obj.name=councilpad
prop councilpad beh.use=Type the council box's code
prop councilpad lock.code=1909
prop councilpad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||The keypad beeps. The council's box opens - the city's own year.\nsignal||councilcode\ngive||story:councilcode*1
prop councilpad else.use=message||Four digits, scratched round the 1 and the 9. The flotilla city's year?
prop dhatchchest if.open=wears|HeadLight*
prop dhatchchest else.open=message||A store cut into the ice under the hatch, pitch black - wear a headlight.
quest title=Beneath the Glacier
quest intro=A door in the glacier, frost on its frame. Make for the ice cap and go to the entrance.
step reach|entrance|1|Make for the ice cap; go to the Coldhold's frosted door in the glacier
step read|Coldhold charter|1|Read the Coldhold charter in the entrance hall
step collect|story:power|1|Pull the generator's lever
step reach|far_side|1|Ride the electric zipline across the crevasse to the far side
step open|Oda's pack|1|Free Oda Fenn from the cage (the keepers' hooks have the key) and open her pack
step read|Oda's notes|1|Read Oda's notes
step kill|Screecher|3|Drive off the three screechers under the ice cap
step reach|seed_wing|1|Go into the seed wing
step collect|story:canister|3|Collect the three seed canisters
step reach|record_wing|1|Go into the record wing
step read|Founders' record|1|Read the founders' record
step read|Why the comms went off|1|Read why the comms went off
step reach|embryo_wing|1|Go into the embryo wing
step collect|story:cooling|1|Crank the embryo wing's cooling
step read|Keeper's last entry|1|Read the keeper's last entry
step read|Control door interlock|1|Read the interlock plate at the control room's door
step collect|story:controlcode|1|Run the three terminals - snowflake, leaf, drop - within ninety seconds
step reach|control|1|Go into the control room
step read|The Warden's ledger|1|Read the ledger on the Warden's desk
step read|Three switches|1|Read the three switches
step collect|story:choice|1|Pull one switch: KEEP, CARRY or BROADCAST
step read|The verdict|1|Read the verdict
step open|The vault's gift|1|Open the vault's gift
step read|Hedda's radio call|1|Read Hedda's radio call
step read|Vent keeper's note|1|The flood door's lever has no interlock. Find the vent keeper's cave beside the ice cap
step reach|vent_top|1|Climb the ice cap on foot to the vent shaft's head
step collect|story:interlock|1|Take the interlock from the chest by the vent shaft
step reach|flood_door|1|Go to the flood door at the far end of the vault, past the control room
step collect|story:flooddoor|1|Open the flood door
quest done=The flood door is open. Down there, the Seed Ark - on 400.
quest reward=MetalIngot*4;CopperIngot*3;TradeToken*6

